### 玩家：保存 0 年财报草稿
### 前提：当前组 0 年已进入 REPORT_OPEN
PUT {{baseUrl}}/player-report/save-draft
Content-Type: application/json
X-Role-Type: {{groupRole}}
X-User-Id: {{groupUserId}}
X-Username: {{groupUsername}}
X-Group-Id: {{groupId}}

{
  "yearNo": 0,
  "reportManualPayload": {
    "workInProgress": 6,
    "finishedGoods": 4,
    "rawMaterials": 1,
    "incomeTaxRate": 0
  }
}

### 玩家：提交 0 年财报
### 前提：当前组 0 年已进入 REPORT_OPEN，且平衡校验通过
POST {{baseUrl}}/player-report/submit
Content-Type: application/json
X-Role-Type: {{groupRole}}
X-User-Id: {{groupUserId}}
X-Username: {{groupUsername}}
X-Group-Id: {{groupId}}

{
  "yearNo": 0,
  "reportManualPayload": {
    "workInProgress": 6,
    "finishedGoods": 4,
    "rawMaterials": 1,
    "incomeTaxRate": 0
  }
}

### 管理员：开放 1 年
### 前提：全部未破产组已完成当前开放年份财报
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin-control/open-next-year
Content-Type: application/json
X-Role-Type: {{adminRole}}
X-User-Id: {{adminUserId}}
X-Username: {{adminUsername}}

{
  "targetYearNo": 1
}

### 管理员：异常解锁
### 前提：目标年份已完成且下一年尚未开放
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin-control/unlock-year
Content-Type: application/json
X-Role-Type: {{adminRole}}
X-User-Id: {{adminUserId}}
X-Username: {{adminUsername}}

{
  "groupId": 1,
  "yearNo": 0,
  "reason": "联调演练：回收 0 年结果后重新提交流程"
}
